OL,3,GNEWSASwiss Garden voted RHS Garden of
OL,4,Athe Year 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FShuttleworth's Swiss Garden has been
OL,7,Fvoted by the public as the winner of
OL,8,Fthe Royal Horticultural Society (RHS)
OL,9,FPartner Garden of the Year 2026
OL,10,Fcompetition.
OL,12,FThe Regency garden in the Swiss
OL,13,FPicturesque or Alpine styles forms part
OL,14,Fof the Grade II* registered Old Warden
OL,15,FPark in Bedfordshire.
OL,17,FThe competition celebrates the
OL,18,Findependent gardens within the RHS
OL,19,FPartner Garden scheme which allow
OL,20,Fmembers to visit for free on certain
OL,21,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
